CompileTimeError: d34_an_assign_inside_a_loop_is_refused.jern:4:9, line 4 column 9
 4 |         assign $label = "x"
   |         ^^^^^^
 what: this `assign` is inside a loop, so it could give `$label` a value more than once, or never
 why:  `assign` gives a `decl` its first value exactly once on each path (D34, standard 3.3)
